//// WHAT IS IT    ////

MilCity is a Real Time Strategy based game. Build your own city, earn money
and produce energy ... and construct weapons ! And, like in a Battleship game, 
you can use these weapons against your opponents. 
Available on all J2ME capable mobile phones !


////	DOWNLOAD    ////

MilCity Blue is FREE. You can download it from SourceForge here :
https://sourceforge.net/projects/milcity/
Check for last update ^^


////	INSTALL    ////

To install MilCity Blue on your cellphone, you need to download lastest JAR file
from SourceForge. Then, simply put it on your cellphone memory, and browse files
in aim to find it with your cellphone file manager, and click on "INSTALL" (or
something like that). 
Your cellphone needs to have at least 300ko of free memory, and must be compatible 
with CLDC 1.0 and MIDP 2.0, and have a screen resolution of 320 x 240 pixels.
(now, I think every cellphone sold must be OK...)


