////	CHANGELOG    ////

####	VERSION 1.0.5
			Fixed : Shielded cells are now wellfully displayed by Spy Satellites (Bluetooth game).
			Fixed : Maximum Score and Starting Money are now synchronized with Bluetooth Server 
				in Multiplayers mode.
			Fixed : Spy satellites now work (they show buildings, and shielded cells).
			Fixed : Firing on a shielded cell is now displayed as firing on the ground (nothing hit).
			Changed : Cost of Nuke Silo and Laboratory.
			
####	VERSION 1.0.4
			Fixed : Players win when they reach their Maximum Score
			Added : Possibility to change starting amount of Money in Options menu.
			Added : Possibility to change Maximum Score to reach in Options menu.
			
####	VERSION 1.0.3
			Fixed : Playing multiple Bluetooth parties without restarting the game is possible.
			Changed : Balance of building costs.
			
####	VERSION 1.0.2
			Fixed : Determination of winner and loser players improved.
			
####	VERSION 1.0.1
			Added : Support of Bluetooth.
			
####	VERSION 1.0.0
			Bug : Cannot play with Bluetooth.
			First public release, but mainly based on solo gaming mode.